  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>A well-placed blast makes a mess of your foot, fracturing tarsal and metatarsal bones, sending toes flying! What remains bears a closer resemble to a puzzle than a foot!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (3), @Condition[Bleeding] (1) and @Condition[Prone]. Lose 1d10/5 toes – Amputation (Average), and suffer a Broken Bone (Major), except you’ll automatically fail all Tests for long-term penalties. Also, you’ll need to pass an <strong>Average (+20) Endurance</strong> Test or gain a Festering Wound.</p>"
    },
